# LogitOS development package-signing key -- Ed25519 public key, raw, hex.
#
# THIS IS A DEVELOPMENT KEY AND ITS PRIVATE HALF IS PUBLISHED IN THIS
# REPOSITORY, on purpose, next to it in DEV-SIGNING-KEY.txt. It exists so that
# `make test-pkg-os` can build a genuinely signed package and so that anyone
# reading the tree can produce one and watch it be accepted. It is NOT a
# security boundary and must never be the only key in a build anyone relies on.
#
# A real deployment: generate a key offline, put ONLY the public half here,
# delete this file, re-run tools/genpkgroots.py, rebuild the ISO. The trust root
# is the ISO -- see the long comment in c/crypto/trust/pkgsig.h.
5ae6e10f769595eff79cf34d365f42fedbe92bc531953a6774e1e2eada3e714e
